cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below.
type: dataset
title: "AI Response Evaluation Benchmarks"
abstract: >-
  Benchmark cases for evaluating economics, econometrics, statistics,
  mathematics, and quantitative-reasoning answers. Each case pairs a prompt
  and a candidate response with an expert review, severity rating, and a
  golden response written to a documented standard.
